    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Cabal of Chaos",
    "summary": "Your units get these bonuses for making a [Dark Pact](vsdata:ability/chaos-space-marines.dark-pacts):\n\n- In [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), whenever a **HERETIC ASTARTES PSYKER** unit of yours that is not a **DAEMON** unit is **selected to shoot** and makes a Dark Pact, its ranged attacks get +1 S.\n- In [either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), whenever a **HERETIC ASTARTES DAEMON PRINCE** or **DAEMON PRINCE WITH WINGS** unit of yours that is not a **KHORNE** unit is **selected to fight** and makes a Dark Pact, its melee attacks get +2 S and +1 AP.",
